id=onyx_gameperf
name=POCO F7 (onyx) Game/Perf + Adreno V842.52 Driver
version=v3.0.1
versionCode=30001
author=alexssandro56 (driver libs: Adreno Laboratory)
description=All-in-one for POCO F7 (onyx): bundles the Adreno V842.52 GPU driver (installed via standard overlay, with an auditable Adreno compatibility gate) + performance/game tweaks, full-res game render, Fortnite pt-BR language, WebUI with games editor and language selector, shader-cache cleaner, and an optional experimental 120fps spoof. Aborts safely on non-Adreno GPUs.
